### Add Dune to Sara's shelf as READING → 201, startedAt = today
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shelf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "bookId": 1, "status": "READING" }

### Add a FINISHED book → 201, currentPage = last page, finishedAt = today
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shelf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "bookId": 3, "status": "FINISHED" }

### No status → defaults to WANT_TO_READ
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shelf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "bookId": 2 }

### Same book again → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shelf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "bookId": 1, "status": "READING" }

### Sara's shelf → 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shelf?userId=1